{"id":"agradable","lemma":"agradable","pos":"adj","rank":706,"glosses":["agreeable, pleasant"],"ipa":"/aɡɾaˈdable/","forms":{"femininePlural":"agradables"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-agradable.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es tan agradable aquí.","en":"It's so nice here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443632"},{"text":"Algunas personas son más agradables que otras.","en":"Some people are nicer than others.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587420"},{"text":"Es agradable y cálido.","en":"It's nice and warm.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450635"},{"text":"Comparados con los tigres, los osos son animales agradables.","en":"Compared to tigers, bears are nice animals."},{"text":"Eres una chica agradable.","en":"You're a nice girl.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/162937"}]}